### How to build the library

**First extraction:** introduce one backward liveness implementation with explicit scope, compare its live-in/live-out sets on both machine clients, and delete each private sweep after parity. Include disconnected blocks, fallthrough, backedges and multiple exits. Measure compile time and memory as well as fact equality. This can proceed independently of the publication fix. `src/typed/backend/regalloc.ts:85`, `src/typed/backend/coalesce.ts:32`, `scripts/08-library-boundaries.mjs:40`.

