**Then:** follow the numbered migration below for witnesses, observation queries, residualization and scheduling. Gate promotion on deletion of two independent implementations or on a second successful instance with materially different inputs. Retain specialized representations when the shared abstraction changes precision, misses a required outcome or imposes substantial projection cost. General polyhedral solving and a cross-domain residualizer remain research decisions. The catalogue specifies how to test them before committing to a framework dependency.

