# Composing compiler transformations and their evidence

The [design review](design-doc/01-what-a-checked-compiler-transformation-should-return.md) assesses six framework layers and proposes six reusable concepts. The [branch survey](various/01-cell-survey.md) identifies the 31 implementation snapshots. The [diary](log/01-diary.md) records the experiments and their limitations.
